<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on July 1.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on July 1.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				  July 1		June 30</p>
<p>Fed acct			 4.605		 16.368</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  31.820		 34.891</p>
<p>Cash balance		  36.425		 51.259</p>
<p>--- Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,281.818	     5,289.840</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $5 million were issued and $219 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
